---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About — Nasser Al Busaidi" description="Who runs this place." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<p class="eyebrow">about</p>
			<h1>Hi — I'm Nasser.</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				<em>Engineer in Muscat, triathlete on the side, lapsed academic in spirit.</em>
			</p>

			<p>
				I make software for a living and write things in my head most evenings. The site
				you're on is the place where some of those things end up.
			</p>

			<p>
				The flagship right now is the <a href="/paper">field report</a> — four years of body
				composition, sleep, HRV, and cycling power data audited against a six-check guardrail.
				Three findings survived. Two were retracted on the page. I think the retractions are
				the interesting part.
			</p>

			<p>
				Around the paper there's a <a href="/field">field</a> log of training milestones and
				race results, a <a href="/stupidshit">stupidshit</a> folder for one-off oddities,
				and a <a href="/blog">blog</a> for everything that doesn't fit the others.
			</p>

			<h2>Where to find me</h2>
			<ul class="links">
				<li>
					<span class="label">email</span>
					<a href="mailto:nasserbusaidi@gmail.com">nasserbusaidi@gmail.com</a>
				</li>
				<li>
					<span class="label">github</span>
					<a href="https://github.com/NasserAlbusaidi">@NasserAlbusaidi</a>
				</li>
				<li>
					<span class="label">strava</span>
					<a href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/nasseralbusaidi">strava</a>
				</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>How this site is made</h2>
			<p>
				Astro static build. Field Journal design system — Fraunces, Source Serif 4, Geist,
				Geist Mono. Cream paper, rust ink. Hosted on Firebase. Source on
				<a href="https://github.com/NasserAlbusaidi/nasser1931.com">GitHub</a>.
				If something looks off, it probably is — the site rebuilds itself a lot.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />

		<style>
			main {
				max-width: var(--container-prose);
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 4rem 1.25rem 2rem;
			}

			.eyebrow {
				font-family: var(--font-mono);
				font-size: 11px;
				font-weight: 500;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.18em;
				color: var(--accent);
				margin: 0 0 1rem;
			}

			h1 {
				font-size: 44px;
				line-height: 1.05;
				letter-spacing: -0.02em;
				font-variation-settings: "opsz" 96;
				margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
			}

			h2 {
				font-size: 22px;
				line-height: 1.3;
				font-variation-settings: "opsz" 36;
				margin: 2.5em 0 0.6em;
			}

			.lede {
				font-size: 19px;
				line-height: 1.55;
				color: var(--ink);
				margin: 0 0 1.5em;
			}

			p {
				font-size: 17px;
				line-height: 1.65;
				margin: 0 0 1em;
			}

			.links {
				list-style: none;
				padding: 0;
				margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
			}

			.links li {
				display: flex;
				gap: 1.5em;
				align-items: baseline;
				padding: 0.55em 0;
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
			}

			.label {
				font-family: var(--font-mono);
				font-size: 12px;
				color: var(--muted);
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.1em;
				min-width: 5em;
				flex-shrink: 0;
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
